    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah i get that. but sometimes it sounds almost like someone is screaming or howling, you know? it's a bit of an intense sound for just some air moving through metal. is there anything else about the way it behaves or the pressure it creates that might explain why it sounds so \"vocal\" or aggressive?",
